#, fuzzy
msgid "Read Ladislav Thon's article \"On the Road to CDI Compatibility\" to learn about the long road to make Quarkus compatible with CDI Lite. An Elsevier software engineer (Neil Stevens) writes about how to use Quarkus to improve Java functions with AWS Lambda in \"Elsevier Tech: Writing a native Java Lambda using Quarkus\". Learn how to quickly deploy Red Hat Quarkus on Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) with a simple CRUD application in Karl Erickson, Delora Bradish, Ed Burns, and Daniel Oh's article \"Deploy a Java application with Quarkus on an Azure Kubernetes Service cluster\".  Otavio Santana shows you how to build a MongoDB-powered RESTful app with Quarkus and Eclipse JNoSQL: generate, configure, create entities, implement services, and expose API in \"Building a MongoDB-Powered RESTful Application With Quarkus and Eclipse JNoSQL\". \"How to send notifications from a Quarkus app to a Telegram Chatbot using Java and the Oracle Database 23c Free — Developer Release\" by Juarez Junior will explore how to use the Telegram Bot API and Quarkus to send message notifications from a Java application to your Telegram Chatbot using the Telegram API."
msgstr "阅读 Ladislav Thon 的文章 \"On the Road to CDI Compatibility\"，了解 Quarkus 与 CDI Lite 兼容的漫长之路。爱思唯尔软件工程师（Neil Stevens）在 \"Elsevier Tech：使用 Quarkus 编写本机 Java Lambda\"。在 Karl Erickson、Delora Bradish、Ed Burns 和 Daniel Oh 的文章 \"在 Azure Kubernetes 服务集群上使用 Quarkus 部署 Java 应用程序 \"中，了解如何在 Azure Kubernetes 服务 (AKS) 上使用简单的 CRUD 应用程序快速部署 Red Hat Quarkus。Otavio Santana 在 \"使用 Quarkus 和 Eclipse JNoSQL 构建由 MongoDB 驱动的 RESTful 应用程序 \"一文中向您展示了如何使用 Quarkus 和 Eclipse JNoSQL 构建由 MongoDB 驱动的 RESTful 应用程序：生成、配置、创建实体、实施服务并公开 API。Juarez Junior 撰写的 \"如何使用 Java 和 Oracle Database 23c Free - Developer Release 从 Quarkus 应用程序向 Telegram 聊天机器人发送通知 \"将探讨如何使用 Telegram Bot API 和 Quarkus，通过 Telegram API 从 Java 应用程序向 Telegram 聊天机器人发送消息通知。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You will also see the latest Quarkus Insights episodes, top tweets and upcoming Quarkus attended events."
msgstr "你还会看到最新的Quarkus Insights剧集、热门推文和即将举行的Quarkus出席活动。"

